{"id":"wb-5-270","name":"游仙寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"游仙寺","text":"游仙寺为中华人民共和国山西省高平市的一座佛寺，位于河西镇宰李村游仙山，并因山而得名，又名慈教院。\n\n游仙寺始建于北宋淳化元年（990年），金至清历代均有重修。寺院坐北朝南，依山而建，共有三进院落。中轴线上有山门、春秋楼、毗卢殿、三佛殿、七佛殿，旁有配殿、厢房和廊庑，其中毗卢殿为北宋原构，三佛殿建于金代并经元代大修，余为明清建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B8%B8%E4%BB%99%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94409929,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94409929","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d8e0644defb763dc5f416ffe.jpg","title":"20260828_Youxian_Temple_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260828_Youxian_Temple_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/20260828_Youxian_Temple_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西高平 游仙寺 毗卢殿","width":320,"height":213}}